    {
      "id": "2.81.2",
      "label": "2.81.2",
      "numbers": [
        2
      ],
      "devanagari": "सुवर्ण कोण अभिहतः प्राणदद् याम दुन्दुभिः |\nदध्मुः शन्खामः च शतशो वाद्यामः च उच्च अवच स्वरान्",
      "iast": "suvarṇa koṇa abhihataḥ prāṇadad yāma dundubhiḥ |\ndadhmuḥ śankhāmḥ ca śataśo vādyāmḥ ca ucca avaca svarān",
      "translation": "A drum from the sound of which nigh-hours are identified, struck with a golden stick, gave its sound. Couches and loud-sounding instruments in hundreds producing various types of noises were blown.",
